      "message": "Probably not.  \n\nI\u0027m waffling about removing the ready transition though since it causes issues with the moshi.  We report discard one cycle before the new message is received in the PE, so we can go from ready to already trying to start a different AMS in this case, which seems undesirable.  If we set a discard flag, it would slow down the PE process to match the PRL\u0027s pace here more.  Thoughts?",
